Spacekraft", "keywords": ["flying", "arcade", "space", "asteroids", "flight"], "long_description": "You are Earth's last surviving Space-Kapit\u00e4n and have to protect Saturn form the evil Gwuarck, an alien race that used their advanced interplanetary Technologie to haul thousands of deadly asteroids towards our beloved solar system!\nDo you have the Willensst\u00e4rke and skill to defend Saturn and avoid eine gro\u00dfe Katastophe for all mankind? Shoot Asteroids, collect Time Crystals and enter the Hall of Fame as the beste Kapit\u00e4n in the whole Universum!", "short_description": "A VR version of the classic Asteroids game. Maneuver your ship, shoot asteroids, and collect time crystals in this arcade space shooter. Play casual or competitive timed runs and compete for your spot on the global leaderboard."}]}, "developer_name": "D\u00e9pendance Tempelhof", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://krakentanz.com/games/meinlittlespacekraft/mls-legal.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Krakentanz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.krakentanz.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "SPACE_UNIVERSE", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26429606206648149"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997708_200001903